Features of Class Components
State Management: Class components handle state management using this.state.
Lifecycle Methods: Class components support lifecycle methods such as componentDidMount, componentDidUpdate, and componentWillUnmount.
this Keyword: Props and state are accessed using this.
State Updates: Class components use setState() for state updates, allowing one or multiple state values to be updated at once.
Re-rendering: Automatically updates the UI when state changes.
